<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.75 pct on Swedish 12-month T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.75 pct on Swedish 12-month T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an auction of 12-month Treasury bills was 4.75 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids for 5.0 billion crowns.</p>
<p>It received 74 bids totalling 19.4 billion crowns and said it accepted eight of them.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
